          <a class="simple-recommend__item" href="https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_53898122/article/details/168754368" target="_blank" rel="noopener"  data-report-click='{"ab":"new","spm":"1001.2101.3001.6650.30","mod":"popu_387","extra":"{\"highlightScore\":0.0,\"utm_medium\":\"distribute.pc_relevant.none-task-blog-2~default~BLOGTAG~default-30-168754368-blog-164253677.235^v43^pc_blog_bottom_relevance_base7\",\"dist_request_id\":\"silkroad_1792902239808\"}","dist_request_id":"silkroad_1792902239808","ab_strategy":"landing_bge_commercial_es","index":"30","strategy":"2~default~BLOGTAG~default","dest":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_53898122/article/details/168754368"}'  data-report-query='spm=1001.2101.3001.6650.30&utm_medium=distribute.pc_relevant.none-task-blog-2%7Edefault%7EBLOGTAG%7Edefault-30-168754368-blog-164253677.235%5Ev43%5Epc_blog_bottom_relevance_base7&depth_1-utm_source=distribute.pc_relevant.none-task-blog-2%7Edefault%7EBLOGTAG%7Edefault-30-168754368-blog-164253677.235%5Ev43%5Epc_blog_bottom_relevance_base7'  data-report-view='{"ab":"new","spm":"1001.2101.3001.6650.30","mod":"popu_387","extra":"{\"highlightScore\":0.0,\"utm_medium\":\"distribute.pc_relevant.none-task-blog-2~default~BLOGTAG~default-30-168754368-blog-164253677.235^v43^pc_blog_bottom_relevance_base7\",\"dist_request_id\":\"silkroad_1792902239808\"}","dist_request_id":"silkroad_1792902239808","ab_strategy":"landing_bge_commercial_es","index":"30","strategy":"2~default~BLOGTAG~default","dest":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_53898122/article/details/168754368"}'>
            <p class="simple-recommend__item-title">「大车小标」自动稽核怎么落地：识别车型与计费车型如何自动比对、争议如何排除</p>
              <p class="simple-recommend__item-desc">在高速公路货车逃费里，&quot;大车小标&quot;是最高频、也最难缠的一类：实际是更大车型、更多轴数的货车，却按更小车型交费，跑同样的路交更少的钱。单次差额可能不大，但放到长距离、高频次、规模化运营的路网里，累积的通行费流失相当可观。自动稽核&quot;大车小标&quot;，核心不是&quot;识别出这是什么车&quot;这么简单，而是要把多个<em>来源</em>的车型判断和最终计费车型自动比对，并在大量正常交易里把真正可疑的少数挑出来，同时把设备误差、遮挡污染造成的误判排除掉。本文拆解这条链路的工程落地思路，全文定性，不涉及具体识别率与金额。</p>
            <div class="simple-recommend__item-meta">
                <span class="simple-recommend__item-author">weixin_53898122的博客</span>
