		<div class="desc-box">
			<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_29032337/article/details/164773927" target="_blank"  data-report-click='{"ab":"new","spm":"1001.2101.3001.6650.12","mod":"popu_387","extra":"{\"highlightScore\":0.0,\"utm_medium\":\"distribute.pc_relevant.none-task-blog-2~default~ElasticSearch~Rate-12-164773927-blog-164253677.235^v43^pc_blog_bottom_relevance_base7\",\"dist_request_id\":\"silkroad_1792902239808\"}","dist_request_id":"silkroad_1792902239808","ab_strategy":"landing_bge_commercial_es","index":"12","strategy":"2~default~ElasticSearch~Rate","dest":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_29032337/article/details/164773927"}'  data-report-query='spm=1001.2101.3001.6650.12&utm_medium=distribute.pc_relevant.none-task-blog-2%7Edefault%7EElasticSearch%7ERate-12-164773927-blog-164253677.235%5Ev43%5Epc_blog_bottom_relevance_base7&depth_1-utm_source=distribute.pc_relevant.none-task-blog-2%7Edefault%7EElasticSearch%7ERate-12-164773927-blog-164253677.235%5Ev43%5Epc_blog_bottom_relevance_base7'>
				<div class="desc ellipsis-online ellipsis-online-1">图像处理是计算机视觉的基石，而多模态大模型的输入并非<em>原始</em>图片，而是经过预处理转换后的张量。OpenCV作为最成熟的图像处理库，承担着读取、通道转换、几何变换、区域掩码等关键职责。模型越强，输入侧越不能含糊，BGR与RGB转换、letterbox缩放、fillPoly掩码等操作直接影响模型输出质量。在16G显存环境下，合理选型与4bit量化能让视觉大模型顺利落地，而OpenCV的标定、轮廓提取等经典算法，也在多模态融合与视觉Agent中焕发新生。从工业检测、情感分析到让Agent&lsquo;看见后行动&rsquo;，OpenCV始</div>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
